# What a toggle-governance request needs. Lines are FIELD: hint; (optional) marks fields that may be left out.
ACTION: add, check or retire-plan
FLAG: the flag name, lowercase with hyphens (optional for check)
MANIFEST: where flags.json lives, relative to the repository (optional; default flags.json)
OWNER AND EXPIRY: for add, the owning seat and the removal date YYYY-MM-DD (optional for check and retire-plan)
